Opener: `bash tools/audit/seat/open_pr.sh r10-<topic> <handoff sha> "<title>" <group> [issues]` via `python3 tools/audit/seat/daemonize.py --log <log> --cwd $PWD --env PREPR_SKIP_CLOSURES=1 -- ...`. Stale ~/.local/state/hpo/pr/r10-<topic>/wt + local fix/r10-<topic> branch must be removed (git worktree remove --force; git branch -D; git worktree prune) before a relaunch.

## On PR=N HEAD=h (every opener/update)
approve_held_runs.sh tvofi/heatpump_optimizer <branch> ; `bus.sh dispatch <pr> <head> pool` (prints bus-nonce; refuses until the head carries dev/programme/delivery/<pr>.md) ; render reviewer:
`python3 tools/audit/seat/cloud_dispatch.py --role reviewer --overlay /Users/timmalmstrom/hpo-orch/r10s6/cloud-overlay.json --topic <pr>-<nonce8> --model claude-opus-5-5 --head <h> --pr <pr> --nonce <nonce> --out payloads/rev-<pr>-<nonce8>.json` then publish with `PYTHONPATH=tools/audit/seat python3` calling cloud_dispatch._publish('.', 'dispatch/reviewer-<pr>-<nonce8>', {PAYLOAD.json, PROMPT.md}) and prepend that ref to POOL.txt on dispatch/rpool-s6 the same way (drop the superseded ref for that PR). Then write `fire-owed-pool #N <head> <nonce> <ref>` in the report and SendMessage main. Delete old claim/s6/rev-<id> first (ls-remote to confirm).

